<!-- 
To add your profile image:

METHOD 1 - Local File (Recommended):
1. Take or choose a professional headshot photo
2. Resize it to approximately 400x400 pixels (square format works best)
3. Save it as 'profile.jpg' 
4. Upload it to the 'public' folder of your project
5. Update Hero.tsx to use: src="/profile.jpg"

METHOD 2 - External URL:
1. Upload your image to a reliable image hosting service like:
   - Imgur (https://imgur.com)
   - Cloudinary (https://cloudinary.com)
   - Your own website/domain
2. Get the direct image URL
3. Update the src in Hero.tsx

The image should be:
- Professional looking
- Good lighting
- Clear and high quality
- Square aspect ratio (1:1)
- File size under 500KB for optimal loading

Current placeholder will show until you replace it with your actual image.
-->